WILL OF FIRE — SHINOBI PLEDGE

I, a registered shinobi of Konohagakure, affirm before the Office of the Hokage:

That I will carry the Will of Fire kindled by the First Hokage and tended by every Hokage since;
That I will treat the village as my family, and my comrades as my kin;
That I will protect the next generation as those before me protected mine;
That I will not abandon a comrade, for in the shinobi world those who break the rules are trash, but those who abandon their comrades are worse than trash;
And that should I fall, my name will be honored at the Memorial Stone, and my will passed to those who follow.

This pledge is a matter of the heart, not of law, and is kept in the shinobi's personal file as a reminder of the flame they carry.

Signed and lodged with the Administration Building.
